    "body": "What do you guys think about GDPR in Magento, it's going to be a Big thing in the EU http://www.eugdpr.org/.\r\n\r\nHow should we approach this as (core / optional) or as a module?\r\nBasically, we have to encrypt the customer's data in the database and every communication with the customer has to be concent.\r\n\r\n**TODO's**\r\n- [ ] Right to be forgotten (Need to validated how it works with orders and invoices)\r\n- [ ] Customer data encrypted\r\n- [ ] Customer Communication Consent (Email, SMS, etc)\r\n- [ ] Third-party customer info (Google Analytics, Hotjar, etc)\r\n- [ ] Customer data export function (All related customer data ex: orders, invoices, logs, customer data, addresses, etc)\r\n- [ ] Log customer data access in the admin\r\n- [ ] Database encryption",
